---
import FaIcon from '../icons/FaIcon.astro';
---

<div class="py-[50px] bg-primary/4 border-t border-primary/5">
	<div class="container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 max-w-7xl">
		<div
			class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-4 sm:gap-6"
			data-reveal-stagger
		>
			<div
				class="about-benefit-orbs about-benefit-orbs--on-dark reveal-hidden relative overflow-hidden rounded-3xl bg-linear-to-br from-primary to-secondary p-6 sm:p-8 text-white flex flex-col justify-between group hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-primary/30 transition-shadow duration-normal"
			>
				<div class="relative z-10">
					<div
						class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-white/20 flex items-center justify-center mb-5 sm:mb-6 group-hover:bg-white/30 transition-colors"
					>
						<FaIcon
							name="fa6-solid:layer-group"
							iconClass="text-xl text-white"
						/>
					</div>
					<h3
						class="font-montserrat font-bold text-lg mb-2 sm:mb-3 leading-tight"
					>
						Все услуги в одной компании
					</h3>
					<p class="text-white/80 leading-relaxed text-sm">
						Авиа и {'ж\u2060/\u2060д'} билеты, туры, визы, отели, круизы, трансферы,
						экскурсии, страхование и полное сопровождение в поездке
					</p>
				</div>
			</div>

			<div
				class="reveal-hidden relative overflow-hidden rounded-3xl bg-white border border-primary/15 p-6 sm:p-8 flex flex-col justify-between group hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-primary/20 transition-shadow duration-normal"
			>
				<div class="relative z-10">
					<div
						class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-primary/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-5 sm:mb-6 group-hover:bg-primary/20 transition-colors"
					>
						<FaIcon
							name="fa6-solid:certificate"
							iconClass="text-xl text-primary"
						/>
					</div>
					<h3
						class="font-montserrat font-bold text-lg mb-2 sm:mb-3 text-gray-900 leading-tight"
					>
						Аккредитации
					</h3>
					<p class="text-gray-500 leading-relaxed text-sm">
						Имеем прямые аккредитации по продаже авиабилетов — IATA, ТКП и
						Аэрофлот для полного контроля оформления авиабилетов
					</p>
				</div>
			</div>

			<div
				class="reveal-hidden relative overflow-hidden rounded-3xl bg-white border border-primary/15 p-6 sm:p-8 flex flex-col justify-between group hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-primary/20 transition-shadow duration-normal"
			>
				<div class="relative z-10">
					<div
						class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-primary/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-5 sm:mb-6 group-hover:bg-primary/20 transition-colors"
					>
						<FaIcon name="fa6-solid:users" iconClass="text-xl text-primary" />
					</div>
					<h3
						class="font-montserrat font-bold text-lg mb-2 sm:mb-3 text-gray-900 leading-tight"
					>
						Работаем для всех
					</h3>
					<p class="text-gray-500 leading-relaxed text-sm">
						Сотрудничаем с частными и корпоративными клиентами, а также
						туристическими агентствами
					</p>
				</div>
			</div>

			<div
				class="reveal-hidden relative overflow-hidden rounded-3xl bg-white border border-primary/15 p-6 sm:p-8 flex flex-col justify-between group hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-primary/20 transition-shadow duration-normal"
			>
				<div class="relative z-10">
					<div
						class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-primary/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-5 sm:mb-6 group-hover:bg-primary/20 transition-colors"
					>
						<FaIcon
							name="fa6-solid:earth-americas"
							iconClass="text-xl text-primary"
						/>
					</div>
					<h3
						class="font-montserrat font-bold text-lg mb-2 sm:mb-3 text-gray-900 leading-tight"
					>
						Работаем по всему миру
					</h3>
					<p class="text-gray-500 leading-relaxed text-sm">
						Оформляем любые туристические услуги дистанционно для клиентов из
						любых регионов и стран
					</p>
				</div>
			</div>

			<div
				class="reveal-hidden relative overflow-hidden rounded-3xl bg-white border border-primary/15 p-6 sm:p-8 flex flex-col justify-between group hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-primary/20 transition-shadow duration-normal"
			>
				<div class="relative z-10">
					<div
						class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-primary/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-5 sm:mb-6 group-hover:bg-primary/20 transition-colors"
					>
						<FaIcon
							name="fa6-solid:people-group"
							iconClass="text-xl text-primary"
						/>
					</div>
					<h3
						class="font-montserrat font-bold text-lg mb-2 sm:mb-3 text-gray-900 leading-tight"
					>
						Сильная команда
					</h3>
					<p class="text-gray-500 leading-relaxed text-sm">
						С вами работают профессионалы с большим опытом, вниманием к деталям
						и любовью к своему делу
					</p>
				</div>
			</div>

			<div
				class="reveal-hidden relative overflow-hidden rounded-3xl bg-white border border-primary/15 p-6 sm:p-8 flex flex-col justify-between group hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-primary/20 transition-shadow duration-normal"
			>
				<div class="relative z-10">
					<div
						class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-primary/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-5 sm:mb-6 group-hover:bg-primary/20 transition-colors"
					>
						<FaIcon
							name="fa6-solid:arrow-trend-up"
							iconClass="text-xl text-primary"
						/>
					</div>
					<h3
						class="font-montserrat font-bold text-lg mb-2 sm:mb-3 text-gray-900 leading-tight"
					>
						Быстро растём и развиваемся
					</h3>
					<p class="text-gray-500 leading-relaxed text-sm">
						За 7 лет стали лидером продаж у ведущих туроператоров и мировых
						отелей
					</p>
				</div>
			</div>

			<div
				class="about-benefit-orbs about-benefit-orbs--on-dark about-benefit-orbs--orb-bl-left reveal-hidden relative overflow-hidden rounded-3xl bg-gray-900 border border-primary/25 p-6 sm:p-8 text-white flex flex-col justify-between group hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-primary/30 transition-shadow duration-normal"
			>
				<div
					class="absolute inset-0 z-0 bg-linear-to-br from-gray-900 to-gray-800 pointer-events-none"
				>
				</div>
				<div class="relative z-10">
					<div
						class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-primary/20 flex items-center justify-center mb-5 sm:mb-6 group-hover:bg-primary/30 transition-colors"
					>
						<FaIcon name="fa6-solid:headset" iconClass="text-xl text-primary" />
					</div>
					<h3
						class="font-montserrat font-bold text-lg mb-2 sm:mb-3 leading-tight"
					>
						Персональный сервис
					</h3>
					<p class="text-gray-500 leading-relaxed text-sm">
						После обращения создаём личный чат с менеджером и круглосуточной
						поддержкой 24/7
					</p>
				</div>
			</div>

			<div
				class="reveal-hidden relative overflow-hidden rounded-3xl bg-white border border-primary/15 p-6 sm:p-8 flex flex-col justify-between group hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-primary/20 transition-shadow duration-normal"
			>
				<div class="relative z-10">
					<div
						class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-primary/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-5 sm:mb-6 group-hover:bg-primary/20 transition-colors"
					>
						<FaIcon
							name="fa6-solid:credit-card"
							iconClass="text-xl text-primary"
						/>
					</div>
					<h3
						class="font-montserrat font-bold text-lg mb-2 sm:mb-3 text-gray-900 leading-tight"
					>
						Удобная оплата
					</h3>
					<p class="text-gray-500 leading-relaxed text-sm">
						Принимаем оплату в рублях из любой точки мира быстро и удобно
					</p>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</div>
